msgctxt "80"
msgid "Uncle Kaz!"
msgstr "Zio Kaz!"

msgctxt "92"
msgid "What's up, Riona?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "104"
msgid "Do you know where Haruka-chan is? I need to talk to her!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116"
msgid "Probably out shopping for groceries if she's not home."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "128"
msgid "Huh!? But I need her now!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "140"
msgid "What's the rush?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "152"
msgid ""
"Well, I'm gonna go hang out with some friends from school,\r\n"
"so I was trying to make a bento."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "164"
msgid ""
"But I can't figure out how to make duruwakashi...\r\n"
"You know, the mashed taro with pork?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "176"
msgid ""
"I've definitely seen Haruka-chan make it before, but I can't\r\n"
"find her anywhere. Do you know how to make it, Uncle Kaz?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "188"
msgid "More or less. I'm not a local, but I can manage."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "200"
msgid "Really? Come on, teach me! Let's go!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "224"
msgid "All right, all right. Calm down."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "284"
msgid "So? Think you understand?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "296"
msgid ""
"Yeah! Thanks, Uncle Kaz! I didn't realize you could make\r\n"
"stuff that wasn't curry!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "308"
msgid "...I guess my menu has been a bit limited at times."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "332"
msgid "Anyway, go have fun. And stay out of the street, okay?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "344"
msgid "Mhm!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "392"
msgid "Ah, Kiryu-san! I couldn't help but overhear!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "404"
msgid ""
"You and that flowery man... Rikiya-kun, was it? You want to\r\n"
"make Mitsuo-kun more popular with the ladies, yes?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "416"
msgid ""
"Uh... yeah. I honestly don't know a whole lot about the\r\n"
"latest trends, though. I was just gonna window shop a bit\r\n"
"downtown."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "428"
msgid ""
"I see. In that case, I'd recommend stopping in the store\r\n"
"<Color:7>right near the big intersection<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "440"
msgid ""
"I've never actually stepped foot in the place myself, but\r\n"
"one of the resident neighborhood housewives seemed very\r\n"
"keen on their products."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "452"
msgid "All right, I'll give it a shot. Thanks, Miyara-san."
msgstr ""

